tracked approved optimizer plan records that the legacy reference was superseded
after the reviewed rounded-stop risk-ceiling correction, and that corrected
version-4 ignored artifact is the one that was later verified. Its bytes were
removed, but its exact introducing commit is present in local Git history.

Reconstruct that corrected reference as follows:

1. Require the exact local commit `da7fd865221517768ed2cd6b5c6ef984aa1f83ba`
